<div class="auth-icon-wrap auth-icon-warn">⏱</div>
<h1 class="auth-title">Link expired</h1>
<p class="auth-subtitle">
  This password reset link has expired or is no longer valid.
</p>

<div class="auth-warning-box">
  <strong>What happened?</strong>
  For your security, password reset links expire after 1 hour.
  <% if (typeof email !== 'undefined' && email) { %>
    The link for <strong><%= email %></strong> can no longer be used.
  <% } %>
</div>

<p class="auth-subtitle" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
  Don't worry — you can request a new link in seconds.
</p>

<p class="auth-links">
  <a href="/forgot-password" class="btn btn-primary" style="display: inline-block; width: 100%;">
    Request a New Link
  </a>
</p>

<p class="auth-links">
  <a href="/login">&larr; Back to Login</a>
</p>